; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR RACER  -  keep the car on a winding road   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot, press a key. The road streams down the screen; <- and -> steer
; the car on lines 22-23, up / down arrows change the speed (1-9), ESC quits.
; Touch either edge of the road and you crash; any key then starts a new game.
;
; VT100: a scrolling region (ESC [ 1 ; 23 r) and reverse index (ESC M) move the
; road; cursor addressing draws the rest.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/racer_verify.py, V0061.33): an autopilot driving from the screen: 300 frames without a crash, every road line exactly two edges 17 apart and moving at most one column a line, the car whole; up/down arrows take SPEED 5->9 (capped) and down to 1 (capped); hands off the wheel it crashes at exactly the first frame the road touches the car's padding; after a crash an arrow key starts a new game and a lone ESC quits (scroll region reset, screen cleared, cursor shown); a rerun without reloading plays cleanly and ESC at the title quits. Frame rate: ~17,500 1802 instructions a frame at speed 9 (~6 frames/s on the Elf2K with 9600-baud output), ~51,000 at speed 1 (~3 frames/s).
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 274 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: the index for patching strings
; D 4009 11 0E 07 B2    LOADXI R14 07B2
; D 400D C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; SEED:
; D 400F C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes: every road differs
; D 4010 CC             SERST
; D 4011 A1 00 0F       IFFALSEI SEED
; D 4014 BD 02 C4       CALL ANYKEY                        Take it (an ESC on its own quits)
; NEW:
; D 4017 11 0E 07 9C    LOADXI R14 079C
; D 401B C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Clear, hide the cursor, scroll region 1-23
; D 401D 11 02 00 20    LOADXI R2 0020
; D 4021 11 03 00 01    LOADXI R3 0001                     straight
; D 4025 11 04 00 17    LOADXI R4 0017                     a straight start
; D 4029 11 05 00 27    LOADXI R5 0027                     the car in the middle
; D 402D 11 06 00 05    LOADXI R6 0005
; D 4031 11 07 00 01    LOADXI R7 0001
; D 4035 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 4039 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; D 403D 11 0D 00 01    LOADXI R13 0001
; D 4041 11 09 0F 00    LOADXI R9 0F00
; D 4045 11 0A 0F 3F    LOADXI R10 0F3F
; D 4049 FB 9A 20       FILLMEMXY R9..RA 20                The ring: the road was straight
; D 404C 11 0C 00 17    LOADXI R12 0017
; PRE:
; D 4050 BD 01 A8       CALL ROADROW                       Draw a straight road down the screen
; D 4053 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 4055 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 4057 A1 00 50       IFFALSEI PRE
; FRAME:
; D 405A BD 02 57       CALL KEYS
; D 405D 43 04          DECX R4
; D 405F 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 4061 A1 00 67       IFFALSEI SAME                      This stretch goes on
; D 4064 BD 01 E5       CALL NEWSEG
; SAME:
; D 4067 50 23 02       ADDXYZ R2 + R3 -> R2
; D 406A 53 02 00 01    SUBXI R2 0001                      L += direction - 1
; D 406E 86 02 00 01    TESTXI R2 0001
; D 4072 A1 00 7D       IFFALSEI C1
; D 4075 11 02 00 02    LOADXI R2 0002
; D 4079 11 03 00 02    LOADXI R3 0002                     hit the left side: turn right
; C1:
; D 407D 86 02 00 3F    TESTXI R2 003F
; D 4081 A1 00 8C       IFFALSEI C2
; D 4084 11 02 00 3E    LOADXI R2 003E
; D 4088 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000                     hit the right side: turn left
; C2:
; D 408C BD 01 A8       CALL ROADROW
; D 408F 50 57 05       ADDXYZ R5 + R7 -> R5
; D 4092 53 05 00 01    SUBXI R5 0001                      x += steer - 1
; D 4096 11 07 00 01    LOADXI R7 0001                     steer used up
; D 409A 86 05 00 01    TESTXI R5 0001
; D 409E A1 00 A5       IFFALSEI C3
; D 40A1 11 05 00 02    LOADXI R5 0002
; C3:
; D 40A5 86 05 00 4E    TESTXI R5 004E
; D 40A9 A1 00 B0       IFFALSEI C4
; D 40AC 11 05 00 4D    LOADXI R5 004D
; C4:
; D 40B0 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 40B3 53 09 00 01    SUBXI R9 0001                      the padding column
; D 40B7 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 40B9 25             COPYMAA
; D 40BA 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40BD 2F 0B 07 1D    WRITEIDX R11 071D
; D 40C1 27             COPYREMA
; D 40C2 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40C5 2F 0B 07 1E    WRITEIDX R11 071E
; D 40C9 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 40CB 25             COPYMAA
; D 40CC 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40CF 2F 0B 07 2A    WRITEIDX R11 072A
; D 40D3 27             COPYREMA
; D 40D4 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40D7 2F 0B 07 2B    WRITEIDX R11 072B
; D 40DB 11 0E 07 18    LOADXI R14 0718
; D 40DF C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The car, with a space either side
; D 40E1 2E 08 0F 0B    READIDX R8 0F0B                    the road's left edge on line 22
; D 40E5 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 40E7 23 00 9A       COPYXY R9 -> R10
; D 40EA 52 09 00 01    ADDXI R9 0001
; D 40EE 88 95          TESTGXY R9 >= R5
; D 40F0 A0 01 47       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the left edge
; D 40F3 52 0A 00 0E    ADDXI R10 000E
; D 40F7 88 5A          TESTGXY R5 >= R10
; D 40F9 A0 01 47       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the right edge
; D 40FC 2E 08 0F 0A    READIDX R8 0F0A                    the road's left edge on line 23
; D 4100 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4102 23 00 9A       COPYXY R9 -> R10
; D 4105 52 09 00 01    ADDXI R9 0001
; D 4109 88 95          TESTGXY R9 >= R5
; D 410B A0 01 47       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the left edge
; D 410E 52 0A 00 0E    ADDXI R10 000E
; D 4112 88 5A          TESTGXY R5 >= R10
; D 4114 A0 01 47       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the right edge
; D 4117 42 08          INCX R8
; D 4119 86 08 00 20    TESTXI R8 0020
; D 411D A1 01 24       IFFALSEI I1
; D 4120 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; I1:
; D 4124 42 01          INCX R1                            distance
; D 4126 43 0D          DECX R13
; D 4128 8C 0D          TESTXZ R13
; D 412A A1 01 34       IFFALSEI NOST
; D 412D BD 02 02       CALL STATUS
; D 4130 11 0D 00 08    LOADXI R13 0008
; NOST:
; D 4134 11 09 00 09    LOADXI R9 0009
; D 4138 51 96 09       SUBXYZ R9 - R6 -> R9               9 - speed delay steps
; DL:
; D 413B 8C 09          TESTXZ R9
; D 413D A0 00 5A       IFTRUEI FRAME
; D 4140 C0 0C          DLYI 0C                            one speed step
; D 4142 43 09          DECX R9
; D 4144 B0 01 3B       GAL DL
; CRASH:
; D 4147 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 414A 53 09 00 01    SUBXI R9 0001
; D 414E 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 4150 25             COPYMAA
; D 4151 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4154 2F 0B 07 38    WRITEIDX R11 0738
; D 4158 27             COPYREMA
; D 4159 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 415C 2F 0B 07 39    WRITEIDX R11 0739
; D 4160 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 4162 25             COPYMAA
; D 4163 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4166 2F 0B 07 45    WRITEIDX R11 0745
; D 416A 27             COPYREMA
; D 416B 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 416E 2F 0B 07 46    WRITEIDX R11 0746
; D 4172 11 0E 07 33    LOADXI R14 0733
; D 4176 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4178 BD 02 02       CALL STATUS
; D 417B 11 0E 08 5E    LOADXI R14 085E
; D 417F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4181 11 0C 00 28    LOADXI R12 0028                    Swallow keys still coming for ~1 s: no accidental restart
; FL:
; D 4185 CC             SERST
; D 4186 A1 01 8A       IFFALSEI FL2
; D 4189 CB             SERIN
; FL2:
; D 418A C0 0C          DLYI 0C
; D 418C 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 418E 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 4190 A1 01 85       IFFALSEI FL
; AGAIN:
; D 4193 C3             RAND
; D 4194 CC             SERST
; D 4195 A1 01 93       IFFALSEI AGAIN
; D 4198 BD 02 C4       CALL ANYKEY                        ESC on its own quits
; D 419B B0 00 17       GAL NEW                            Anything else (arrows too): drive again
; QUIT:
; D 419E 11 0E 08 AA    LOADXI R14 08AA
; D 41A2 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 41A4 00             HALT
; D 41A5 F0 00 00       BREAK
; ROADROW:
; D 41A8 22 02          COPYXA R2 -> Acc
; D 41AA 2F 08 0F 00    WRITEIDX R8 0F00                   this line into the ring
; D 41AE 2F 08 0F 20    WRITEIDX R8 0F20                   ... twice
; D 41B2 4D 2F          DIVXY R2 / R15                     left edge column
; D 41B4 25             COPYMAA
; D 41B5 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41B8 2F 0B 07 0A    WRITEIDX R11 070A
; D 41BC 27             COPYREMA
; D 41BD 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41C0 2F 0B 07 0B    WRITEIDX R11 070B
; D 41C4 23 00 29       COPYXY R2 -> R9
; D 41C7 52 09 00 11    ADDXI R9 0011
; D 41CB 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15                     right edge column
; D 41CD 25             COPYMAA
; D 41CE 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41D1 2F 0B 07 13    WRITEIDX R11 0713
; D 41D5 27             COPYREMA
; D 41D6 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41D9 2F 0B 07 14    WRITEIDX R11 0714
; D 41DD 11 0E 07 00    LOADXI R14 0700
; D 41E1 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 41E3 BE 00          RETURN
; NEWSEG:
; D 41E5 C3             RAND
; D 41E6 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
